ker and gains Low-Altitude Hovering","Returns devoured Operator when defeated"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":35000,"atk":450,"def":1500,"res":40,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"duck_lord":{"slug":"duck_lord","name":"Duck Lord","icon":"/enemies-icons/Duck Lord.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"A famous Columbian investor, entrepreneur, and master of 'Duck Power.' Out of the public eye, enjoys kicking back with others...","abilities":["Cannot be blocked.","Gains significantly increased Movement Speed after being attacked"],"levelCount":3,"level":2,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":0.4,"stats":{"hp":65000,"atk":100,"def":400,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1}},"crying_thief":{"slug":"crying_thief","name":"Crying Thief","icon":"/enemies-icons/Crying Thief.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A Perro who left his family to seek out a new life... but all that people know is that he is always weeping.","abilities":["Invisible","Attacks Stun the target"],"levelCount":3,"level":2,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":25000,"atk":600,"def":250,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.8}},"fatty":{"slug":"fatty","name":"Fatty","icon":"/enemies-icons/Fatty.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"Duck Lord's associate and apprentice, an opportunist with a slick tongue. Frequently appears on dubious TV shows, preaching about how he cares little for losses or gains, as they are part of the natural money-making process.","abilities":["Always faces the direction with the most Operators.","Takes 80% less Physical/